        <!-- ========== LEGEND NOTE ========== -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Hybrid Encryption Scheme:&#xa;───────────────────────&#xa;• AES-256-CBC encrypts the CSV data (symmetric, fast)&#xa;• RSA/ECB/OAEP-SHA256 encrypts the AES key (asymmetric)&#xa;• IV is randomly generated (16 bytes) per batch&#xa;• AES key &amp; IV transmitted as Base64 strings&#xa;• Encrypted CSV transmitted as binary (multipart file)&#xa;• Only the receiver's RSA private key can decrypt the AES key" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=18;fillColor=#FFF9C4;strokeColor=#F9A825;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
